---
const requirements = [
 {name:'One offline device',reason:'The device must work without a network. A local SQLite file is a candidate; a required remote database would break the offline promise.',results:['Candidate: local file, then test contention and host recovery.','Rejected as the required offline store: the network can be absent.','Rejected as the required offline store: remote coordination needs a network.']},
 {name:'Our shared reservation service',reason:'Three application hosts must change the same stock. A shared database service fits this boundary; distributing SQL has no extra requirement to satisfy yet.',results:['Reject direct shared-file WAL across hosts. A single-host database API would be a different candidate.','Shortlist: one primary service, with the required recovery topology still to prove.','Defer: no requirement yet justifies the added coordination and operating cost.']},
 {name:'Survive a whole region',reason:'Now the service must accept correct reservations after losing a region. A single-region primary and standby arrangement fails this new gate. A distributed candidate must prove its placement, quorum, client and latency contract.',results:['Reject this one-host arrangement for the region-loss gate.','Reject the single-region topology. Evaluate a different cross-region topology separately.','Evaluate: a correctly placed, supported topology may meet the gate; the product name alone does not pass it.']}
];
---
<figure class="selection-gates" data-selection-gates data-requirements={JSON.stringify(requirements)}>
 <figcaption><span>Figure 3</span> Change the promise, then change the shortlist</figcaption>
 <div class="choices" role="group" aria-label="Application requirement">{requirements.map((r,i)=><button type="button" data-requirement={i} aria-pressed={i===1}>{r.name}</button>)}</div>
 <p data-reason aria-live="polite">{requirements[1].reason}</p>
 <div class="candidates">{['Embedded file','Single-region server','Distributed relational service'].map((name,i)=><div><p><strong>{name}</strong></p><p data-result={i}>{requirements[1].results[i]}</p></div>)}</div>
 <p class="note">Reasoned screening, not observed acceptance. A rejected topology does not reject every deployment of its engine.</p>
 <details><summary>All requirement comparisons as text</summary>{requirements.map(r=><div><p><strong>{r.name}</strong> — {r.reason}</p><ul>{r.results.map((result,i)=><li>{['Embedded file','Single-region server','Distributed service'][i]}: {result}</li>)}</ul></div>)}</details>
</figure>
<script>
 document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-selection-gates]').forEach(root=>{
  const cases=JSON.parse(root.dataset.requirements!);
  root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-requirement]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{
   const selected=Number(button.dataset.requirement), row=cases[selected];root.querySelector('[data-reason]')!.textContent=row.reason;
   root.querySelectorAll('[data-result]').forEach((node,i)=>node.textContent=row.results[i]);root.querySelectorAll('[data-requirement]').forEach((node,i)=>node.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(i===selected)));
  }));
 });
</script>
<style>
 .selection-gates{border:1px solid var(--color-rule);background:var(--color-surface);padding:1rem;margin:2rem 0}figcaption{font-weight:650}figcaption span{display:block;font-size:.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}.choices{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;margin-top:1rem}button{font:inherit;font-size:.85rem;min-height:44px;padding:.5rem .7rem;background:var(--color-surface-alt);color:var(--color-text);border:1px solid var(--color-rule);cursor:pointer}button[aria-pressed=true]{box-shadow:inset 0 -3px var(--color-text)}button:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-text);outline-offset:3px}.candidates{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.6rem}.candidates>div{border:1px solid var(--color-rule);padding:.6rem;min-width:0}.candidates p{font-size:.85rem;margin:.4rem 0}.note{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}details{font-size:.85rem;margin-top:1rem}summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:44px}@media(max-width:600px){.candidates{grid-template-columns:1fr}.selection-gates{padding:.75rem}}
</style>
